              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "Solution"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "lqswkx4gnrp78y9",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use the ideal gas law to calculate the initial pressures, then set up an ICE table. Since "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is very small, the reaction will go almost completely to the left, with Y"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " as the limiting reactant."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1h2tveigwqsalkv",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "qm2a9r8qw9xs19k",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "zp6xa8ggpido89g",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;2\\;{\\mathrm{XY}}_3\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\rightleftharpoons\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; {\\mathrm X}_2\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;+\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;3\\;{\\mathrm Y}_2\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\\\\\mathrm I:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; 0\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;0.800\\;\\mathrm{atm}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;1.20\\;\\mathrm{atm}\\\\\\mathrm C: \\;\\;\\;\\;+0.800\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;-0.400\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;-1.20\\;\\;\\\\\\mathrm E:\\;\\;\\;\\; 0.800\\;\\mathrm{atm}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;0.400\\;\\mathrm{atm}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\sim0\\;\\rightarrow\\;x\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Set up the equilibrium constant expression and solve for "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "x"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "vkqb25zkkds89qz",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "uv49u47y5fft5dv",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "sn511de9pbjqg7x",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "K_{\\mathrm p}\\;=\\;\\frac{\\left(P_{{\\mathrm X}_2}\\right)\\left(P_{{\\mathrm Y}_2}\\right)^3}{\\left(P_{{\\mathrm{XY}}_3}\\right)^2}\\;=\\;\\frac{\\left(0.400\\right)\\left(x\\right)^3}{\\left(0.800\\right)^2}\\;=\\;5.73\\times10^{-8}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
